    //////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////*/

    /// @dev Withdraw funds from the initiated deposit, that failed when finalizing on L2.
    /// @param _depositSender The address of the deposit initiator.
    /// @param _l1Token The address of the deposited L1 ERC20 token.
